            "set_id": "L06-cf_loop_forms-001",
            "title": "Authorization decision: guard clauses vs loop-based iteration",
            "description": "The same resource-authorization decision in three distinct control-flow forms: carrier A uses early-return guard clauses (pristine), carrier B re-expresses the grant-check logic using foreach iteration over grants, carrier C uses the cf_match_guard match(true) dispatch form. All three are behaviorally identical via equivalence_test.php. The loop form in carrier B is a genuine control-flow rewrite of the guard-clause style.",
